  "title": "Raisin Bread I",
  "description": "This not-too-sweet raisin bread with a cinnamon accent is made without yeast, so you will not have to wait nearly so long to enjoy it.",
  "authors": [
    "Carol"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-08-29T14:30:59-04:00",
